WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.166
Ana gets seven cards in order and calls “Come At Me!”

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:10.770
Ben takes his free shot. He trades his 1 for Ana’s last card.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:13.696
Ana’s row is broken. The hit earns her a Fix-It marker and a repair draw.

00:00:13.696 --> 00:00:20.946
She draws 44 and puts it in the last slot.

00:00:20.946 --> 00:00:24.300
All seven cards are in order. Ana wins.
